{{PageBanner|Eve l 036 en.png|event}}
'''[[:Category:Crazed Cats|Crazed Cats]]''' are a group of [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cats]] that are unlockable by clearing their own Insane-labeled stages, which appear twice a month. Their release dates were in April 2014 <sup>[[Nyanko Daisensou|BCJP]]</sup>.

==About Crazed Cats==
Crazed Cats are enhanced versions of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] from [[Empire of Cats]]. At the same level, Crazed Cats always have better stats compared to their Normal Cat counterparts. Not only health and attack power, but the Crazed Cats also have other statistics as well, such as additional abilities, speed or reduced summoning costs. There are some downsides, as the Crazed Cats can only be leveled to level 20 at first, and require specific [[User Rank]]s to be upgraded further to level 30. As of the [[Version 15.6 Update]], their current level cap is 50 using [[Catseye]]s, and some lack their Normal counterpart's abilities.

