==Crazed Festival==
[[File:Eve l 036 en.png|500px|center|link=]]
As of December 2023, on the 26th, 27th, and 28th of every month, certain Crazed Cat stages appear again in addition to their already scheduled dates.

==[[Clan of the Maniacs]]==
Introduced in [[Version 8.9 Update|Version 8.9]], a set of special stages that was added and appears on the 1st day of every month. It is unlocked after clearing every Crazed Cat Stage (excluding Crazed Moneko).

:''Main article: [[Clan of the Maniacs]].''

